---
description: Commit attribution must be Bitcraftly, never Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

Never add Cursor attribution to git commits, PRs, or code comments.

When committing:
- Do not include `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or `cursoragent@cursor.com`
- Do not include `Made-with: Cursor` or `Made with Cursor`
- If a co-author trailer is needed, use: `Co-authored-by: Bitcraftly <team@bitcraftly.com>`
